      "text": "[9:07PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe service lane along Anthony inward Maryland Intersection, and onwards Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, is presently witnessing a smooth traffic flow.\n\nThe entire stretch of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is experiencing an unencumbered traffic movement.\n\nFurthermore, traffic is calm along various road segments, including Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\nOfficers are on ground at their respective locations ensuring a smooth flow of traffic, and as of this moment, no impediments to traffic flow have been recorded.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
