      "text": "[9:46PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe stretch on Eko Bridge, commencing from NEPA Intersection inward to Apongbon, is presently witnessing a satisfactory flow of traffic.\n\nDescending Eko Bridge inward, and ascending CMS Bridge to connect CMS, is experiencing a smooth traffic movement.\n\nFurthermore, the stretch from Carter Bridge descending inward to Ebute-Ero Market, Leventis, through UBA Roundabout, and connecting Inner and Outer Marina, is also proceeding without hindrance.\n\nNotably, Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo, is experiencing better movement.\n\nAdditionally, CMS Bridge stretch inward to Offin Canal Market, extending to Ijora Olopa by NEPA Intersection, is witnessing good traffic flow.\n\nAs of this moment, no impediments to traffic flow have been reported, indicating a favourable traffic situation within the area.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
